{"id":"660091","name":"擂椒皮蛋","author":"莉莉呀Lilly","authorId":"12967468","desc":"","cover":"images/660091/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青椒","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青椒去头清洗干净沥干备用。","img":"images/660091/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"皮蛋表皮去灰洗干净。","img":"images/660091/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"老姜和蒜清洗后剁碎末。","img":"images/660091/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"皮蛋剥壳后备用。","img":"images/660091/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅烧油倒入青椒。","img":"images/660091/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煎至起皮放入一勺盐。","img":"images/660091/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用大碗装起来，放入姜蒜沫。","img":"images/660091/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入皮蛋。","img":"images/660091/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒一勺酱油。","img":"images/660091/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"捣碎。","img":"images/660091/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"混合再捣碎。","img":"images/660091/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装盘开吃。","img":"images/660091/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}